## Flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/apps/erts/erl_cmd.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Idle schedulers sleep at once instead of spinning while they wait for work.
## On Fly's shared CPUs spinning spends the CPU allowance on no work and makes
## the CPU charts overstate load.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
